[2026-09-19T06:43:21.057Z] RECV: method=tools/call id=2 params={"name":"create_meeting","arguments":{"title":"Sprint 42 Retrospective","transcript":"Alex: Welcome everyone. We successfully shipped the user profile redesign on Wednesday.\nSarah: Great, but database queries are slowing down during peak hours. I will optimize the PostgreSQL indexing and analyze slow query plans by this Friday.\nAlex: Good plan. Michael, can you update the API documentation and prepare the release notes before next Monday?\nMichael: Yes, I am on it. I will finalize and publish the documentation by Monday 5 PM.\nAlex: Perfect, let's wrap up."}}
[2026-09-19T06:43:22.770Z] SEND: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"id\": \"5250463b-ef89-438e-a7d4-ac4db3beeff4\",\n  \"title\": \"Sprint 42 Retrospective\",\n  \"status\": \"ANALYZING\",\n  \"message\": \"Meeting created successfully. The AI multi-agent pipeline is analyzing the transcript.\"\n}"}]}}
[2026-09-19T06:43:41.885Z] RECV: method=tools/call id=3 params={"name":"get_meeting_summary","arguments":{"meetingId":"5250463b-ef89-438e-a7d4-ac4db3beeff4"}}
[2026-09-19T06:43:42.476Z] SEND: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"title\": \"Sprint 42 Retrospective\",\n  \"summary\": {\n    \"id\": \"1e0ee936-2846-4c3a-878d-5e9d16bcd3f9\",\n    \"title\": \"User Profile Redesign Release Follow-up Meeting\",\n    \"overview\": \"The team reviewed the successful launch of the user profile redesign and identified performance concerns with database queries during peak usage. Action items were assigned to address indexing optimization and to finalize API documentation and release notes for the upcoming release.\",\n    \"keyDecisions\": [\n      \"Sarah will optimize PostgreSQL indexing and analyze slow query plans by Friday.\",\n      \"Michael will update the API documentation and publish release notes by Monday 5 PM.\"\n    ],\n    \"discussionTopics\": [\n      \"Completion of user profile redesign deployment\",\n      \"Database query performance issues during peak hours\",\n      \"API documentation and release notes preparation\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"status\": \"COMPLETED\"\n}"}]}}
[2026-09-19T06:44:14.096Z] RECV: method=tools/call id=4 params={"name":"get_followup_email","arguments":{"meetingId":"5250463b-ef89-438e-a7d4-ac4db3beeff4"}}
[2026-09-19T06:44:14.950Z] SEND: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"subject\": \"Follow-up: User Profile Redesign Release – Action Items\",\n  \"recipients\": [\n    \"Sarah\",\n    \"Michael\",\n    \"Project Manager\",\n    \"Team Lead\"\n  ],\n  \"body\": \"Hi Team,\\n\\nThank you for attending the User Profile Redesign Release Follow‑up Meeting. Below is a brief recap of the key decisions and the action items assigned:\\n\\n**Key Decisions**\\n- Sarah will optimize PostgreSQL indexing and analyze slow query plans.\\n- Michael will update the API documentation and publish the release notes.\\n\\n**Action Items**\\n1. **Optimize PostgreSQL indexing and analyze slow query plans**\\n   - *Assignee*: Sarah\\n   - *Due*: Friday\\n   - *Context*: Database query performance issues during peak hours\\n2. **Update API documentation and publish release notes**\\n   - *Assignee*: Michael\\n   - *Due*: Monday by 5 PM\\n   - *Context*: API documentation and release notes preparation\\n\\nPlease confirm that the above tasks and deadlines are clear. If you encounter any blockers or need additional information, let me know as soon as possible.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n[Your Name]\\n[Your Position]\\n[Your Contact Information]\",\n  \"reviewed\": false\n}"}]}}
