[2026-09-21T09:33:29.259Z] RECV: method=tools/call id=4 params={"name":"create_meeting","arguments":{"title":"Team Sync Call","transcript":"Participants: Arpit, Abhinav, Siddhi\nMeeting Type: Project Sync Call\nArpit: Hey guys, shall we start? Let's quickly go through everyone's progress and make sure we're on track for the deadline.\nAbhinav: Yeah, sure. I've completed most of my assigned work. I just have a few remaining tasks to finish and test.\nSiddhi: Same here. My main implementation is done, but I still need to complete the testing and fix a couple of small issues.\nArpit: Okay. For my side, I'm working on the remaining development tasks. I'll make sure they're completed and pushed before the deadline.\nAbhinav: Sounds good. I'll finish the pending implementation and testing and share the updated work with everyone.\nSiddhi: I'll complete the testing, resolve the remaining issues, and push everything before the deadline as well.\nArpit: Great. So everyone is clear on their pending work?\nAbhinav: Yes.\nSiddhi: Yes, clear.\nArpit: Perfect. Let's make sure we don't leave anything pending at the last moment. We'll complete our respective tasks within the agreed deadline and update the team once they're done.\nAbhinav: Agreed.\nSiddhi: Agreed.\nArpit: Alright, then. Let's get it done before the deadline. Thanks, everyone.\nAbhinav: Thanks.\nSiddhi: Thanks, everyone."}}
