[2026-09-21T10:25:16.265Z] SEND: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"subject\": \"Follow-up: Project Sync Call – Action Items and Next Steps\",\n  \"recipients\": [\n    \"Arpit\",\n    \"Abhinav\",\n    \"Siddhi\",\n    \"Project Team\"\n  ],\n  \"body\": \"Hi Team,\\n\\nThank you for attending the Project Sync Call – Status Update and Deadline Commitment. As discussed, we are on track with implementation and need to finalize testing and resolve any remaining issues before the project deadline.\\n\\nBelow are the action items agreed upon:\\n\\n- **Arpit**: Complete remaining development tasks and push updates before the deadline.\\n- **Abhinav**: Finish pending implementation and testing, then share the updated work with the team before the deadline.\\n- **Siddhi**: Complete testing, resolve remaining issues, and push all changes before the deadline.\\n- **All team members**: Update the team once individual tasks are completed, before the deadline.\\n\\nPlease ensure these items are addressed as scheduled and keep the group informed of your progress. If you encounter any blockers, let us know promptly so we can assist.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n[Your Name]\\n[Your Position]\\n[Your Contact Information]\",\n  \"reviewed\": false\n}"}]}}
