[2026-10-08T09:08:47.057Z] SEND: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"subject\": \"Follow-up: Finalization of New Mobile App Launch Plan – Action Items & Next Review Meeting\",\n  \"recipients\": [\n    \"Vikram\",\n    \"Ananya\",\n    \"Rohit\",\n    \"Project Lead\"\n  ],\n  \"body\": \"Dear Team,\\n\\nThank you for the productive meeting on Finalization of New Mobile App Launch Plan. As a quick recap, we agreed to proceed with a simultaneous Android and iOS launch pending QA approval, and to make load testing a release dependency.\\n\\nBelow are the action items assigned during the meeting:\\n\\n- Fix the session handling issue – **Vikram** – due **Tomorrow** (2026-10-09)\\n- Fix the push notification issue and test across Android and iOS – **Vikram** – due **in two days** (2026-10-10)\\n- Prepare and execute a basic load test and share the results – **Vikram** – due **Monday** (2026-10-12)\\n- Perform a three‑day regression testing cycle after critical fixes are applied – **Ananya** – due **three days after fixes are available**\\n- Deliver final app store screenshots – **Rohit** – due **Thursday afternoon** (2026-10-12)\\n- Create first draft of launch campaign (email announcements, social media posts, in‑app banner) – **Rohit** – due **Friday** (2026-10-13)\\n\\nWe have scheduled a review meeting to assess readiness for app store submission on **Tuesday, October 10, 2026 at 10:00 AM**. Please confirm your availability.\\n\\nIf you have any questions or need to adjust timelines, let me know.\\n\\nBest regards,\\n[Your Name]\",\n  \"reviewed\": false\n}"}]}}
